Let \(E_k\) be the expected time to success *starting from state k* (\(0 \leq k \leq N\)). The equations are:
    \[
    \begin{align*}
    E_{N} &= 1 + \frac{1}{2} \cdot 0 + \frac{1}{2} \cdot E_{N+1} \quad &\text{(from state N:)} \\
    E_{k} &= 1 + \frac{1}{2} \cdot E_{k+1} + \frac{1}{2} \cdot E_{k-1} \quad &\text{(for } 1 \leq k \leq N-1{,} \\
    E_{0} &= 1 + \frac{1}{2} \cdot E_{1} + \frac{1}{2} \cdot E_{0} \quad &\text{(for state 0:)} \\
    E_{N+1} &= 0 \quad &\text{(absorbing state, time 0)}
    \end{align*}
    \]
